            {
              "id": "1768272701520_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Create an automated email in rich HTML format to notify the sourcing team about a newly created campaign for a job requisition using the following dynamic variables:\n\nJob Name: {{$context.$variables.BoName}}\nJob Description: {{$context.$variables.BoDescription}}\n\nCampaign Details:\nCampaign Name: {{$context.$variables.CampaignName}}\nCampaign Code: {{$context.$variables.CampaignCode}}\nCampaign ID: {{$context.$variables.CampaignId}}\nCampaign Audience Count : {{$context.$variables.CandidateCount}}\nCampaignLink: \" {{$context.$variables.HostName}}/fscmUI/redwood/recruiting-sourcing/?selectedTab=campaigns\"\nCampaign Email Design Link: \"{{$context.$variables.HostName}}/hcmUI/CandExpSecured/emailDesigner?campaignCode={{$context.$variables.CampaignCode}}&assetId={{$context.$variables.AssetId}}&campaignType=ORA_REC_CAMPAIGN\"\n\n\n\nGuidelines for the email content:\n1) Total word count must be under 500.\n2) Start the email by addressing \"Sourcing Team\"\n3) Include a Campaign Link in the body.\n4) Include Campaign Email Design in the body.\n4) Provide a summary of Search Criteria and Number of Candidates Found.\n5) Do not include any salutation or regards/signature block in the email.\n6) Do not include Agent Name or Agent Trace ID in the signature.\n7) Return the email in an RFC 8259-compliant JSON object format with the subject and content.\n8) Do not use code blocks, backticks, or markdown.\n9) No regards needed in email"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"subject\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n       \"content\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n       }\n    }\n}",
